    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": "6.11.1.1 For Road Racing a minimum of two allocated numbers and number plates are required:",
      "text": "6.11.1.1 For Road Racing a minimum of two allocated numbers and number plates are required:\na) One on the front, either in the centre of the fairing or slightly off to one side, is mandatory, \nand either b) or c) below.\nb) One across the top of the rear seat section with the top of the number facing toward the \nrider.\nc) One on each side of the fairing or on the lower rear portion of the lower fairing.\n\n33\n6 ROAD RACE\n2026 MANUAL OF MOTORCYCLE SPORT",
      "chapter": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": "6.11.1.2 Number plates must:",
