      "chapter": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": "6.12.3.3 The 1st, 2nd, 3rd and 4th placed Machines must be impounded for a period of 30 minutes",
      "text": "6.12.3.3 The 1st, 2nd, 3rd and 4th placed Machines must be impounded for a period of 30 minutes \nimmediately following the Race, pending any protest, and the Race result will be provisional;\na)\t  At\tthe\tconclusion\tof\tthat\tperiod,\tif\tno\tprotest\tis\treceived,\tthe\tresult\twill\tbe\tfinal,\nb) If any such Machine is to be ridden in another Competition within that period, that Machine \nmust be sealed before being returned to the competitor for that Competition,\nc) If no protest is received within that period, the seals may be removed.",
      "chapter": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": "6.12.3.4 Any Machine sealed as the result of a protest may only be measured by a Measurer. All",
      "text": "6.12.3.4 Any Machine sealed as the result of a protest may only be measured by a Measurer. All \nMeasurer’s reports, together with the seals, must be delivered to the RCB within 21 days after the \nEvent.",
      "chapter": 6
    },
