      "text": "6.12.4.2\t   At\tVenues\twhere\tnight\tracing\tis\tpermitted\tthe\tfollowing\twill\tapply\tonce\tthe\ttrack\tflood\tlighting\thas\t\nbeen turned on:\na) No illuminate numbers are permitted,\nb)\t  All\tmotorcycles\tshould\tbe\tfitted\twith\ta\tred\trear\tlight\tto\taid\tofficials\tat\tthe\tEvent,\twhich\t\nshould be activated for all sessions/races, \nc)\t  The\tred\trear\tlight\tthat\tis\tfitted\tto\tthe\tmotorcycle\tshould\tmeet\tthe\tfollowing\trequirements:\t\ni) Lighting direction should be parallel to the motorcycle center line (motorcycle running \ndirection), and clearly visible from the rear, \nii) Securely mounted on the seat/rear bodywork approximately on the machine center \nline, \niii) Power output/luminosity equivalent to approximately: 10 – 15W (incandescent) 0.6 – \n1.8 W (LED), \niv) The original taillight is permitted,\nv) No working rear brake light is permitted,\nvi) No glass-lensed lights are permitted.\n All motorcycles should be checked for a functioning red rear light during technical inspection. The \ndecision\tof\tthe\tChief\tTechnical\tOfficer\twill\tbe\tfinal\twith\trespect\tto\tcompliance\tto\tthese\tregulations.\n6�12�5          Qualifying",
