      "text": "6.12.6.1 All competitors must, in relation to the start of any Competition, comply with directions issued by, \nand under the authority of, the Starter. For such purposes the Starter, on the instructions of a key \nofficial,\tmay:\na) Delay a start,\nb) Direct a Re-start,\nc) Direct a competitor to start from:\ni)  The back of the starting grid,\nii) The pit lane,\niii)\t  The\trear\tof\tthe\tfield,\tor\niv) Such other position as shall be required for the safe, fair and orderly start of the \nCompetition.\nd) Exclude a competitor who is late for the start.",
