      "text": "6.12.13.2\t  If\tthe\tCompetition\tcontinues,\tany\tcompetitor\tunable\tto\tcross\tthe\tfinish\tline\tas\ta\tresult\tof\tsuch\t\nconduct\ton\tthe\tpart\tof\tthe\tExcluded\tcompetitor\tmay\tbe\tdeemed\tto\thave\tfinished\tthe\tCompetition\t\nin the place:\na)\t  Held\timmediately\tbefore\tsuch\tconduct,\tor\nb)\t  Having\tregard\tto\tany\tadvancement\tin\tplacing\tfollowing\tthe\texclusion,\tin\tsome\tother\tplace.",
