      "text": "6.22.1.1\t   A\tlanyard\toperated\tignition\tcut-out\tswitch,\toperating\ton\tthe\tprimary\tcircuit,\tmust\tbe\tfitted\tto\tall\t\nsidecars. The lanyard may be up to a maximum of one metre in length.\n6�22�2 Engine Capacity Tolerances",
      "chapter": 6
