      "text": "6.22.2.1 The actual engine capacity of a Machine competing in a sidecar capacity class may not exceed \nthe prescribed capacity for that class by more than 2%, provided that the upper limit of 1300cc is \nnot exceeded.\n6�22�3 Frames and Parts",
