      "text": "6.22.3.2 The ground clearance, measured at the lowest point of the Motorcycle and sidecar, Race-ready \nwith rider and passenger on board and with the handlebars in the straight ahead position, must \nbe not less than 65mm. After a Race, a tolerance of -5mm is allowed. After a wet Race this check \nis not performed.",
      "chapter": 6
    },
