      "text": "6.22.3.3 The engine must be positioned:\na) In such a way that the centre line of the engine must not exceed 160mm beyond the centre \nline of the rear wheel of the Motorcycle,\nb) In front of the rear wheel.",
      "chapter": 6
    },
