      "text": "6.28.2.3 In the absence of qualifying, the Clerk of Course must allocate starting grid positions.\n6�28�3 False Starts",
      "chapter": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": "6.28.3.1 Upon\trecommendation\tof\tthe\tClerk\tof\tCourse,\ta\tboard\tshowing\t“Stop\t&\tGo”\tas\twell\tas\tthe\triding",
      "text": "6.28.3.1\t   Upon\trecommendation\tof\tthe\tClerk\tof\tCourse,\ta\tboard\tshowing\t“Stop\t&\tGo”\tas\twell\tas\tthe\triding\t\nnumber\twill\tbe\tshown\tat\tthe\tfinish\tarea\tto\tthe\trider\twho\tmade\tthe\tfalse\tstart.",
      "chapter": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": "6.28.3.2 The rider making the false start must:",
      "text": "6.28.3.2 The rider making the false start must:\na)\t  Go\tto\tthe\tdesignated\t“Stop\t&\tGo”\tpenalty\tzone,\nb) Bring their Machine to a stop (the engine must not be turned off),\nc) Remain stationary for a full second.",
      "chapter": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": "6.28.3.3 The rider may then re-join the Race.",
      "text": "6.28.3.3 The rider may then re-join the Race.",
      "chapter": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": "6.28.3.4 This\tprocedure\tis\tunder\tthe\tstrict\tcontrol\tof\tthe\tdesignated\tofficials,",
      "text": "6.28.3.4\t   This\tprocedure\tis\tunder\tthe\tstrict\tcontrol\tof\tthe\tdesignated\tofficials,\na)\t  If\ta\trider\tfails\tto\tstop\tafter\tbeing\tshown\tthe\tStop\t&\tGo\tboard\tthree\ttimes,\tthe\trider\twill\tbe\t\nblack\tflagged,\nb) If more than one rider is to be penalised, the riders will be signaled on subsequent laps,\nc)\t  Where\tthe\tofficials\thave\tbeen\tunable\tto\tcarry\tout\tthe\t“Stop\t&\tGo”\tprocedure\tbefore\tthe\tend\t\nof the Race, the rider will incur a time penalty of 15 seconds.",
      "chapter": 6
