      "text": "7.20.6.1 Open to all 2-stroke and 4-stroke production-based road Machines. To be eligible for racing, the \nMotorcycle must be a production model manufactured between 1991 – 1999. Period 7 Production \nMachines must comply with Road Race GCR 7.14 and 7.20.",
